          <h2 class="section-title" id="about-project-heading">About Kolte Patil Evara, Borivali West by Kolte Patil Developers Ltd</h2>
          
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Kolte Patil Evara is a residential development project in Borivali West, Mumbai. Well connected to highways, shopping centres, schools, retros, multiplexes, and hospitals, Kolte Patil Evara Borivali, Mumbai is developed by well-known Kolte Patil Developers. The Kolte Patil Evara, Borivali Mumbai is a RERA registered project with ID P51800026949. The project features two buildings and is located just 1.2 km from the Borivali Railway Station.</p><p>Situated in the city that never sleeps, Kolte Patil Evara Mumbai is a residential development project in the most admirable locations of Mumbai at Borivali West. The 15-storey residential building offers all the essential amenities making it a notch above the ordinary. Kolte Patil Evara, Borivali Mumbai features 115 units across 0.61 acres of the project area. Kolte Patil Evara’s Floor Plan offers 1-BHK, 2-BHK and 2.5 BHK apartments covering 463 sq. ft. to 750 sq. ft. of area. The residential building is well connected to other parts of the city and is developed by Kolte Patil Developers.<br></p><p>The under-construction project by Kolte Patil Developers is predicted to start with possession around April 2024.</p></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

      </section>



      
