            <div id="master-plan-details-panel-1" class="master-plan-details master-plan-detail-panel active">
              <h3 class="master-plan-title">Master Plan 1</h3>
              
                
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text master-plan-info"><div class="item"><strong>Overview about Kolte Patil Evara</strong><ul><li>Kolte Patil Evara is a residential project located in the desirable neighborhood of Borivali West, Mumbai. It offers a well-connected living experience with a focus on community and modern features. The project provides a comfortable stay with premium fittings and a secure environment.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Land Use and Density</strong><ul><li>Around 10%-18% of the plot is green, anchored by the Yoga Lawn and a general this amenity, providing residents with spaces for relaxation and outdoor activities.</li><li>The open area covers 45%-58% of the plot, and the Shopfront Plaza, Entrance Plaza, and Pergola Sitting fill the non-green stretches, giving residents places to gather and relax outside their doors.</li><li>Only 25%-35% of the plot has been built on, so homes here get more air and light than in a tightly packed complex, with ample breathing space around the residential building.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Connectivity Access</strong><ul><li>The New Link Road and Western Express Highway are close by, making commutes and daily errands convenient for residents. A dedicated drive way, multiple entry points, and surface parking ensure smooth access and movement within the complex.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Amenities Lifestyle</strong><ul><li>A Fitness Centre at the 1st Podium lets residents handle their exercise routines without stepping outside the community.</li><li>A Kids Play Area, Amphitheatre, and Hobby/Activity Zone mean children and families have dedicated spaces for recreation and social interaction within the complex.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Tower Placement Orientation</strong><ul><li>The main residential structure is centrally located on this amenity, providing a commanding view of the surrounding amenities.</li><li>The building's footprint is integrated with this amenity, allowing for direct access to the various outdoor zones.</li><li>Its position ensures that many homes overlook the landscaped areas and activity spaces on this amenity.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Amenity Access</strong><ul><li>Residents can easily walk to the STAGE and this amenity from any part of the main building.</li><li>The ACTIVITY TABLE and TABLES FOR GAMES are conveniently placed for quick access from residential units.</li><li>Access to the CHIT CHAT ZONE is direct and requires minimal travel across this amenity level.</li><li>The SCULPTURE and various SEATING areas are distributed to be within easy reach for all residents.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Noise Privacy Road Facing</strong><ul><li>Homes facing the outer perimeter of the complex might experience some sound from the surrounding DRIVE WAY.</li><li>Units overlooking this amenity benefit from the buffer of amenities, creating a quieter living environment.</li><li>The central placement of the building on this amenity helps to distance residences from external street noise.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Corridor Analysis</strong><ul><li>The building's design on this amenity creates open spaces around its edges, allowing for good light and air circulation.</li><li>Gaps between different sections of the building ensure that homes receive natural light and maintain open views.</li><li>The layout promotes an airy feel, as the structure is not densely packed on this amenity.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Internal Circulation Pedestrian</strong><ul><li>Pedestrians can move freely across this amenity level, connecting various amenity zones without encountering cars.</li><li>Dedicated pathways on this amenity link areas like this amenity spots and the central this amenity.</li><li>The design allows for residents to stroll between different activity areas and landscaped sections.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Child Senior Friendly Zones</strong><ul><li>This amenity level offers a secure environment for children to play, separated from the main DRIVE WAY.</li><li>Older residents can comfortably use the numerous this amenity options found throughout the landscaped areas.</li><li>The flat surfaces and clear pathways on this amenity make it easy for all ages to navigate the amenity spaces.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Green Cover Landscape</strong><ul><li>Greenery is integrated into this amenity level, forming pockets of planted areas and soft landscaping.</li><li>Shrubs and trees are strategically placed around this amenity and other this amenity zones, adding natural elements.</li><li>Landscaped sections are interspersed with hardscaped areas, creating a varied texture across this amenity.</li><li>The green spaces are designed as continuous elements, enhancing the visual appeal of the central amenity deck.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Traffic Flow Access Planning</strong><ul><li>The complex features a distinct ENTRY point on the eastern side and an EXIT point on the western side for cars.</li><li>The DRIVE WAY encircles the central this amenity, providing access to different sections of the property.</li><li>Cars enter the property from the east and exit from the west, ensuring a one-way flow around the building.</li><li>The design separates the main DRIVE WAY from the elevated this amenity, minimizing direct car-pedestrian interaction.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Overall Livability Assessment</strong><ul><li>This area offers a well-designed central amenity deck, fostering a strong sense of community and outdoor engagement.</li><li>The project provides a balanced environment where residential comfort is enhanced by accessible recreational and social spaces.</li><li>Thoughtful integration of green elements and diverse activity zones creates a pleasant and engaging living setting.</li><li>Residents benefit from a secure and amenity-rich this amenity, making daily life convenient and enjoyable within the complex.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Final Summary</strong><p>Living at this area offers a well-connected urban lifestyle with convenient access to major roads and essential services. Families will appreciate the dedicated play areas and activity zones, providing safe and engaging spaces for children and community interaction. This project stands out for its balanced approach to built and open spaces, ensuring a comfortable and airy environment in a bustling city.</p></div></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false" id="master-plan-details-readmore-1">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

              
            
          </div>
          
       
        
