 <section class="white-box frequently-asked-questions" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
          <span class="section-label">FAQs</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions About Kolte Patil Evara</h2>
          <div class="faq-box">
            
            <article class="faq-item active">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">Who is the developer of Kolte Patil Evara? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-1">
                <p>Kolte Patil Evara is developed by Kolte Patil Developers Ltd, a reputed developer with 29 years of experience and 155 completed projects.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">Is buying a flat in Kolte Patil Evara legally safe? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-2">
                <p>Yes, Kolte Patil Evara is registered under RERA with registration number P51800026949, ensuring transparency and regulatory compliance.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">Is Kolte Patil Evara more expensive than under-construction projects nearby? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-3">
                <p>Ready to Move projects like Kolte Patil Evara may be priced slightly higher, but they eliminate construction delays, GST, and rental overlap costs.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">When was Kolte Patil Evara completed and is it ready for possession? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-4">
                <p>Kolte Patil Evara has received its completion and occupancy approvals. With a possession status of Ready to Move, buyers can move in immediately after completing purchase formalities.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5">What are the popular amenities available at Kolte Patil Evara? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-5">
                <p>Residents of Kolte Patil Evara can enjoy amenities such as Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, PNG, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant, designed for comfort and a modern lifestyle.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
          </div>
      </section>


