  <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization","name":"Square Yards","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","contentUrl":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","caption":"Square Yards"},"image":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo"},"address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"M3M Urbana Business Park, 1st Floor, Tower A, Sector 67","addressLocality":"Gurgaon","addressRegion":"Haryana","postalCode":"122102","addressCountry":"IN"},"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"connect@squareyards.com","availableLanguage":"en"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/SquareYards","https://www.linkedin.com/company/square-yards","https://www.youtube.com/@Square_Yards","https://www.instagram.com/square_yards/"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#website","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","name":"Square Yards","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization"},"inLanguage":"en-IN"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/kolte-patil-developers-ltd-projects/457/builder#organization","name":"Kolte Patil Developers Ltd","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/kolte-patil-developers-ltd-projects/457/builder","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kolte-patil-developers-ltd-457.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kolte-patil-developers-ltd-457.jpg","caption":"Kolte Patil Developers Ltd developer logo"},"description":"Kolte Patil, a real-estate developer located in the opulent town of Pune, Maharashtra, has been serving the nation for the last 25 years. Kolte Patil Developers has taken charge of creating landmarks across Pune, Bangalore and Mumbai. They established themselves in Jalgaon in 1970 and got incorporated in 1991. The firm follows a simple yet broader motto of Creating something, not just constructing a property; it is all about innovation, creativity and finesse architecture that, altogether, the property speaks for itself.\r\nThey dominate Pune, and in the last 3 decades, they have completed more than 50 projects cumulatively, including commercial hubs, IT Parks and residential complexes. They come under the category of being the Best Realtor in Pune, listed on BSE and NSE as the richest real estate marketers. The founder always had the vision when Mr Aniruddha Patil stepped up into the real-estate playing field that they’ll not be just in the category of construction but also apply the best of their visions brought to life in front of them, and this saying stands true when it comes to seeing their extravagant row houses and opulent bungalows.\r\nThe Kolte Patil company has taken up the project of taking their employees altogether to create landmarks, aesthetically pleasing localities, finesse architecture, and spaces that are present-perfect and future-proof and compliments everyone as per contemporary standards. They have proven their mission to the core by developing projects in multiple segments ranging from commercial, residential, retail, IT parks and much more, and they will continue to do so in future as well. As listed on Square Yards, Kolte Patil Developers Ltd has 156 total projects, of which 121 are delivered."},{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kolte-patil-evara/113717/project#primaryimage","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kolte-patil-evara-project-project-large-image1.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kolte-patil-evara-project-project-large-image1.jpg","caption":"Cover image of Kolte Patil Evara, Borivali West, Mumbai"},{"@typ